{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaarmi Tycoon is an incremental simulator where you build and optimize your own content creation empire. Your channel grows automatically: videos are uploaded regularly and generate revenue based on the equipment, upgrades, and components you've purchased. Each upload displays its own progress bar, and upon completion, your available funds increase, allowing you to further expand your setup.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The heart of the game lies in the component store, where you can purchase and upgrade a wide variety of parts for your computer and workspace. From essential hardware like CPUs, RAM, and storage, to peripherals, accessories, and items that boost your video earnings, each category has its own tiered system, costs, and benefits, allowing you to design a growth strategy tailored to your style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game also includes a save system, allowing you to continue your game at any time and keep expanding your channel without losing your progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaarmi Tycoon will continue to grow with new mechanics, tweaks, and content, always driven by community feedback. Your participation is key to shaping this digital simulation experience.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899230?t=1768917481","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899230/febd6edf7886e6ddcd77e1cbd7b1bbb05d70b7e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768917481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899230/8b58d997595a6bdd5e8d161f2762d5044d00cde3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768917481","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899230/8b58d997595a6bdd5e8d161f2762d5044d00cde3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768917481","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaarmi Tycoon is an incremental simulator where you build and optimize your own content creation empire. Your channel grows automatically: videos are uploaded regularly and generate revenue based on the equipment, upgrades, and components you've purchased. Each upload displays its own progress bar, and upon completion, your available funds increase, allowing you to further expand your setup.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The heart of the game lies in the component store, where you can purchase and upgrade a wide variety of parts for your computer and workspace. From essential hardware like CPUs, RAM, and storage, to peripherals, accessories, and items that boost your video earnings, each category has its own tiered system, costs, and benefits, allowing you to design a growth strategy tailored to your style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game also includes a save system, allowing you to continue your game at any time and keep expanding your channel without losing your progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yaarmi Tycoon will continue to grow with new mechanics, tweaks, and content, always driven by community feedback. Your participation is key to shaping this digital simulation experience.</strong></p>","developers":["Yago Arribas Miguel"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899230/0611425d456c97955a3e92830df102adc66355bd/header.jpg?t=1768917481","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.a